{"vid":"gQtGLz7zQc8","source":"gQtGLz7zQc8.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.5,"txt":"For 30 years, April has meant something"},{"t":6.3,"txt":"bigger for the welding community. It's a"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"time to recognize the people and the"},{"t":11,"txt":"work that quite literally hold our world"},{"t":13.7,"txt":"together. From bridges and buildings to"},{"t":16.4,"txt":"pipelines, power generation, aerospace,"},{"t":19.2,"txt":"and advanced manufacturing, welding"},{"t":21.6,"txt":"makes modern life possible. That's why"},{"t":24.2,"txt":"every April since 1996, the American"},{"t":27.2,"txt":"Welding Society has celebrated National"},{"t":29.8,"txt":"Welding Month. A time to spotlight the"},{"t":32.2,"txt":"skilled professionals behind the trade,"},{"t":34.4,"txt":"share their stories, and inspire the"},{"t":36.7,"txt":"next generation of welders. This April,"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"join us in celebrating the people, the"},{"t":41.6,"txt":"craft, and the careers that keep our"},{"t":43.8,"txt":"world moving forward. Follow along,"},{"t":46.2,"txt":"share the message, and help us spread"},{"t":48.1,"txt":"the word. Celebrate National Welding"},{"t":50.6,"txt":"Month with us this April. Visit"},{"t":52.7,"txt":"aws.org/nweldingmonth"},{"t":55.9,"txt":"to join the celebration."}],"words":[{"t":3.52,"w":"For"},{"t":3.84,"w":"30"},{"t":4.24,"w":"years,"},{"t":4.799,"w":"April"},{"t":5.2,"w":"has"},{"t":5.44,"w":"meant"},{"t":5.759,"w":"something"},{"t":6.319,"w":"bigger"},{"t":6.72,"w":"for"},{"t":6.879,"w":"the"},{"t":7.04,"w":"welding"},{"t":7.52,"w":"community."},{"t":8.4,"w":"It's"},{"t":8.639,"w":"a"},{"t":8.88,"w":"time"},{"t":9.04,"w":"to"},{"t":9.28,"w":"recognize"},{"t":9.76,"w":"the"},{"t":10.08,"w":"people"},{"t":10.4,"w":"and"},{"t":10.719,"w":"the"},{"t":10.96,"w":"work"},{"t":11.28,"w":"that"},{"t":11.679,"w":"quite"},{"t":11.92,"w":"literally"},{"t":12.639,"w":"hold"},{"t":13.04,"w":"our"},{"t":13.36,"w":"world"},{"t":13.679,"w":"together."},{"t":14